{"id": "swebq0056", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Salt Lake City has a lot of great things to do. You can go snowboarding in the winter or hiking in the summer, visit Temple Square for some history and culture, check out the Natural History Museum, explore the Utah State Capitol, or take a stroll through downtown with its vibrant street art and local shops. There are also plenty of restaurants offering everything from traditional American fare to international cuisine.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
