{"id": "swebq0168", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Islamic people believed in the oneness of God, called Allah, and followed a prophet named Muham mad. They also believe d that God sent messengers to guide humanity, including previous prophets like A braham, Moses, and Jesus. Their faith includes believing in angels, the day of judgment, life after death, and following the Five Pillars of Islam.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "swebq0176", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Louisiana State Senator is a member of the Louisiana Senate, which is part of the state's leg islative branch. The Senate has 39 members, and each senator represents one of the state's districts. These senators are responsible for creating and passing laws that affect the entire state, covering issues like education, healthcare, transportation, and environmental policies. They work alongside the House of Represent atives to make decisions that shape life in Louisiana. Each senator serves a four-year term and can be re-elected as many times as voters support them.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
